&lt;p&gt;
	DLL&amp;rsquo;s food and beverage provisions have always taken pride in their exemplary standards of food hygiene. Our food hygiene processes, based on Food Standards Agency guidance, have served us well, illustrated by the fact that prior to this Inspection, all of our facilities had held 5-star food hygiene ratings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	In the period leading up the Inspection visit, we had reported an issue to a specialist contractor in accordance with our procedures, and we believed we were proactively managing the issue and implementing all of the contractor&amp;rsquo;s recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Whilst we are naturally disappointed with the findings, we accept them and have already taken immediate steps to implement the additional and secondary processes that were recommended by the Inspection team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	We will be requesting a reinspection, with a view to restoring a rating which is a true reflection of our high standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	We are extremely proud of the reviews we regularly receive from customers and we have built a strong following both locally and from visitors to the area. We want to reassure them that this is a one-off issue and not a true reflection of the high quality offer at the North Wales Bowls Centre.&lt;/p&gt;
